      "rule": "log_odds_interpolate: runs without a fitted entry of the same base and strand (strand 'both' if no strand-specific entry) interpolate the error log-odds and error shape linearly between the nearest fitted lengths on both sides; beyond the longest (or below the shortest) fitted length the error odds of that entry are scaled by exp(log_odds_slope_per_base * length difference); bases without fitted entries, or references without a usable error delta, use the generic pmf",
